# STD: Pelaaja ja aloitus

> Koottu vakiokirjaston luvuista (STD 3 ja 8). Speksi on normatiivinen,
> joten muutos tehdään ensin speksiin.

namespace STD

component PLAYER
- class card default DEFAULT.PLAYER

entity DEFAULT.PLAYER
- HP now 10
- MELEE 1d4
- PACK
- blocks move
- ALIGNMENT 0
- FACTION GROUP.PLAYER
- sight radius 8
- hearing
- ai behavior HUNTER
- render GLYPH.PLAYER

```roguescript
query WITNESSED(e: entity) -> bool:
    return player != none and (e == player or sees(player, e))

on begin() as SPAWN_PLAYER:
    if game has PLAYER:
        control(spawn(game.PLAYER.class, at: game.at))
    else:
        control(spawn(DEFAULT.PLAYER, at: game.at))
```
